> SYNTAX TEST "Packages/Carve/Carve.sublime-syntax"

A quoted item owns a `> +` right below it when a quoted block follows; a
quote's first-line `> +` is text when the next line is quoted as deep.

> - a
> +
  > <- markup.list.continuation.carve

> - a
>+
 > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

> +
  > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

> > +
> <- markup.list.continuation.carve

A follower whose quote markers are indented is refused (markup-carve/carve#3529).

> > +
  > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

- a
  > > +
    > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

A continuation marker after quote prefixes needs a space after each `>`
(markup-carve/carve#3421). `>+`, `>>+` and `>> +` are no quote lines, and
`> >+` is one quote holding the text `>+`.

> - a
>
>+
 > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
 > <- -markup.quote.carve
> <- -punctuation.definition.quote.carve

> > - a
> >
>>+
  > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
  > <- -markup.quote.carve
 > <- -markup.quote.carve
> <- -punctuation.definition.quote.carve

> > - a
> >
>> +
   > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
   > <- -markup.quote.carve
 > <- -markup.quote.carve
> <- -punctuation.definition.quote.carve

> > - a
> >
> >+
   > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
   > <- markup.quote.carve
  > <- -punctuation.definition.quote.carve
> <- punctuation.definition.quote.carve

>+
 > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
 > <- -markup.quote.carve

> >+
   > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
  > <- -punctuation.definition.quote.carve

Blank quote lines as deep as a quoted item may sit between it and its `> +`.
The block below has to sit behind the same markers at the same column, so an
indented `  > x` (lazy text in the `+` paragraph) leaves the `+` as text.

> - a
>
> +
> ^ markup.quote.carve markup.list.continuation.carve punctuation.definition.list.continuation.carve
> b

> - a
>
>
> +
> ^ markup.list.continuation.carve
> b

> - a
>   
> +
> ^ markup.list.continuation.carve
> b

> 1. a
>
> +
> ^ markup.list.continuation.carve
> b

> - a
>
> +
  > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
  > <- markup.quote.carve

> - a
>
> > +
    > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

> > - a
>
> > +
    > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

> > - a
> >
> +
  > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve

> > - a
> >
> > +
    > <- -markup.list.continuation.carve
